{% if content_results %}

Below are excerpts from the original source materials. Use these to add explanatory depth — explain WHY findings matter, HOW they connect to each other, and provide background context that goes beyond the extracted learnings. Cite each source using the token shown in its `<id>` tag, in the `[^S1]` format.
<sources>
{% for source in content_results %}
    <source>
        <id>{{ source.citation_id }}</id>
        <title>{{ source.title }}</title>
        <author>{{ source.author }}</author>
        <created_at>{{ source.created_at }}</created_at>
        <content>{{ source.content }}</content>
    </source>
{% endfor %}
</sources>
{% endif %}
